---
code: host-evidence-admission-refused
when-fires: bounded host evidence failed closed admission before entering the decision plane.
why: host evidence remains controller-owned and decision-inert until admission succeeds.
---
-- book.sh --
#!/bin/sh
hork tune --profile web

-- edge-fault --
host-evidence invalid-utf8

-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=book.sh > /dev/null
records: error[host-evidence-admission-refused]: Dorc refused this attempt's
probe records before using them: the stream failed an admission check (framing,
size, structure, or identity), so none of it became a fact and no plan was
produced.
